# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# Local environment and secrets. Keep the empty template versioned.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local spike outputs, generated viewers, and database dumps
.local/
docker/*.dump

# Editor/IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
.agents/
# Datos de entrada del pipeline.
#
# No se versionan: los tres pasan el límite de 100 MB de GitHub y entre los
# tres son 2,4 GB, así que estaban volviendo impracticables el clon y el push.
# Se bajan de sus fuentes públicas; ver "Datos de entrada" en el README.
viajes_BAdata_20241016.csv
colectivos-gtfs.zip
colectivos-gtfs/stop_times.txt

# Basura del Finder.
.DS_Store
